1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,315
Then walls form.

2
00:00:01,315 --> 00:00:09,661
Three nuclei at the micropylar end become cells of the egg apparatus: the egg, flanked by two synergids.

3
00:00:09,661 --> 00:00:13,294
Three at the chalazal end become the antipodals.

4
00:00:13,294 --> 00:00:17,044
And one nucleus from each end moves to the middle.

5
00:00:17,044 --> 00:00:21,471
These are the two polar nuclei, sharing the big central cell.

